-- Same grid as simple_cube.grdecl, but every pillar slopes: it runs from (x, y, 0)
-- at the top to (x + 0.75, y + 0.375, 1.5) at the bottom, i.e. dx/dz = 0.5 and
-- dy/dz = 0.25. ZCORN is unchanged, so each corner at depth z must sit at
-- (x + 0.5 z, y + 0.25 z). The cells are sheared cubes with the same volume
-- (0.125) as in simple_cube.

